too, even when you show a number they typically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:12.240
will still try how to start you out either at&nbsp;
the minimum number or in between the minimum and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:18.800
